   "t": " means 'acted' or 'behaved'. The ending shows it is a woman who acted.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nastya",
   "t": "И ты меня красиво защитил, Костя.",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'And you protected me so nicely, Kostya.' Now let's inspect the phrase: ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
