  },
  {
   "v": "nastya",
   "t": "защитил",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": " is the man's past form for 'protected'.",
   "gap": 0.4
  },
  {
   "v": "nastya",
   "t": "Может, ты сегодня придёшь в гости?",
   "gap": 0.55
  },
  {
   "v": "narrator",
   "t": "'Maybe you will come visit me tonight?' The expression ",
   "gap": 0.25
  },
